@startmindmap 01-neovim-keybinds
title neovim keybind map

* keybinds
left side
** native no plugin
*** browse
**** - : parent directory
*** multicursor
**** Q : cursor on word or selection
**** [count]Q : cursor per match
**** q= : follow mode
**** gQ : restore cursors
**** CTRL-L : clear cursors
*** comment
**** gc : toggle comment
**** gcc : toggle line comment
*** treesitter selection
**** v_an : grow selection
**** v_in : shrink selection
**** v_]N v_[N : jump to sibling node
**** v_al v_il : select buffer or line
*** lsp defaults
**** K : hover
**** grn : rename
**** gra : code action
**** grr : references
**** gri : implementations
**** gO : outline
**** grt grx : other lsp defaults
**** [d ]d : diagnostic jump
**** C-W d : diagnostic popup
*** completion
**** C-n C-p : walk completion menu
**** Enter : accept
*** folds
**** za zR zM : toggle fold, open all, close all
right side
** leader space
*** session and upkeep
**** q : quit window
**** x : write and re-source
**** ' : alternate file split
**** u : pack update
*** pickers fzf-lua
**** e : global
**** n : combine
**** / : grep buffer
**** z : live grep
**** f : files
**** h : help tags
**** k : keymaps
**** l : loclist
**** m : marks
**** t : quickfix
*** git fzf-lua
**** gf : git files
**** gs : git status
**** gd : git diff
**** gh : git hunks
**** gc : git commits
**** gl : git blame
**** gb : git branches
**** gt : git tags
**** gk : git stash
*** lsp
**** \ : all-in-one finder
**** dd : document diagnostics
**** dw : workspace diagnostics
**** , : incoming calls
**** . : outgoing calls
**** a : code actions
**** s : document symbols
**** w : workspace symbols
**** r : references
**** i : implementations
**** o : type definitions
**** j : definitions
**** v : declarations
**** b : format buffer
*** document preview
**** pt : typst preview toggle
**** ps : live preview start
**** pc : live preview close
**** ; : live preview pick
@endmindmap
